# Optional frontend override.
# Local dev already defaults to http://localhost:8000 (or the Vite proxy for /api),
# so you normally do not need this file.
#
# In production (e.g. the Render static site), set this at BUILD time to the
# deployed backend URL so every API call targets it:
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com